# Auto OTA after mobile features

**User standing instruction:** After finishing any Expo mobile JS/asset feature or bugfix, publish EAS Update to production **automatically** without asking. The user explicitly authorized ongoing auto-OTA for every added feature.

## Command

```bash
CI=1 npx eas-cli update --channel production --message "<short what/why>" --non-interactive
```

From repo root.

## Scope

- Do OTA for mobile app JS/UI changes.
- If agency web changed in the same work, deploy web the usual project way as well.
- Briefly note if SQL migration or edge function deploy is still required (those are not OTA).
- Skip OTA only for: pure SQL, pure web-admin/marketing sites, docs-only, or native binary-only changes.
